{"id":"conversacio_n","lemma":"conversación","pos":"noun","rank":953,"glosses":["conversation"],"ipa":"/kombeɾsaˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conversaciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-conversaci%C3%B3n.wav","formAudio":{"conversaciones":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-conversaciones.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"No interrumpas nuestra conversación.","en":"Don't interrupt our conversation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734455"},{"text":"Las conversaciones de paz fracasaron de nuevo.","en":"The peace talks failed again.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600007"},{"text":"Mary interrumpió nuestra conversación.","en":"Mary broke in on our conversation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/352461"},{"text":"Se me da siempre fatal empezar conversaciones.","en":"I'm always lousy at starting conversations."},{"text":"Ella destaca en conversación inglesa.","en":"She is good at speaking English.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527457"}]}